s/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/002-a3f78746f4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n“增田的可达鸭”也开始配信啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后是\n\n可达鸭销售姐姐！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/003-2b9755915e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/003-2b9755915e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n此外，\n全国各地的宝可梦中心也有活动！\n\n<br>\n\n\n购买5张\n宝可梦卡牌游戏卡牌，\n就能获得宝可萌心的\n可达鸭＆增田卡牌作为礼物！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n先来\n\n\n和来参加签名会的大家\n\n在抽选前合影留念！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/004-559a6865ea.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/004-559a6865ea.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/005-f365ae0142.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/005-f365ae0142.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/006-e4d14398f9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/006-e4d14398f9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/007-61275b911f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/007-61275b911f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/008-c444489930.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/008-c444489930.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/009-0121625535.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/009-0121625535.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/010-f7a90a86d0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/010-f7a90a86d0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/011-ac31acd293.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/011-ac31acd293.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/013-9f631fa0e6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/013-9f631fa0e6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/014-4d819b4a13.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/014-4d819b4a13.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/015-b3e73ee743.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/015-b3e73ee743.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/016-d5fada6170.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/016-d5fada6170.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/017-e45723c90a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/017-e45723c90a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/018-a5fc62ace7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/018-a5fc62ace7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/019-ae38f91e7c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/019-ae38f91e7c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n近400位朋友\n\n聚集到了东京湾！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家能来这么多，\n\n真的让我特别开心！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n大家谢谢你们！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后就在宝可梦中心里的\n\n这里\n\n举行签名会！\n\n<br>\n\n（签名会进行中的照片又忘记拍了（笑））\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/020-8f0f4d4fb9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/020-8f0f4d4fb9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n看得出来吗？\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n桌子上……不得了吧（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n因为来参加签名会的朋友灵机一动，\n\n桌子上变得全是替身！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n真的到处都是替身啊（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/021-06c711945c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/021-06c711945c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"292\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    只要一个点子，\n就能变成这么有趣的空间！\n太棒了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今天也和大家\n度过了一段愉快的时光！\n谢谢大家来参加签名会，\n真的非常感谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n没能抽中的大家，\n\n也谢谢你们从一大早就过来！\n\n感谢！！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">本日\n\nマスダのサイン会が行われました！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n今日は「みがわり」ものの\n発売日でもありますが\nもちろんコダックもたくさん！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/001-76d9501bb9.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/001-76d9501bb9.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"850\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/002-a3f78746f4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/002-a3f78746f4.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n「マスダのコダック」も配信！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\nコダック売りのお姉さん！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/003-2b9755915e.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3457903/003-2b9755915e.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure> \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらに\n全国のポケモンセンターでも！\n\n<br>\n\n\nポケモンカードゲームを\n5枚購入すると\nポケキュンの\nコダック＆マスダのカードを\nプレゼント！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nまずは\n\n\n\nサイン会に来てくれたみんなと\n\n抽選前の記念撮影！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure c